{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12314","headline":"见上林春鴈翔青云寄杨起居李员外 · 钱起","name":"见上林春鴈翔青云寄杨起居李员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上林春更好，宾鴈不知归。\n顾影怜青籞，传声入紫微。\n夜陪池鹭宿，朝出苑花飞。\n宁忆寒乡侣，鸾凰一见稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}